post-it: Can't open images
cause: Programs lost their .EXE
symptoms:
	Can't open pictures
	Programs won't start
checks:
	yes: Programs lost their .EXE
		shows: in C:\WINDOWS: NOTEPAD, WORDPAD, PBRUSH, CALC and others
	no: Folder of icons hidden in a corner
	no: CD tray opens and closes by itself
	no: Unknown program in StartUp
	no: Folders take seconds to open
software steps:
	Open C:\WINDOWS
	Add .EXE back to each program
